{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a7339aa9dc5a833d9d43","chatId":"3dbd2a19b8f4401a97db63846c9fc61e","sessionId":null,"userId":99545,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2272,"promptTokens":440,"completionTokens":210,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:46:59"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006690584973643243,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a7339aa9dc5a833d9d42","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794484019339,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:46:59","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a7339aa9dc5a833d9d42","chatId":"3dbd2a19b8f4401a97db63846c9fc61e","sessionId":null,"userId":99545,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n小杨和几个同事要晚宴招待一位合作伙伴，他们还打算晚饭后去比尔酒吧继续聊聊。她想告诉更多同事加入晚饭后的酒吧聚会，于是在工作群里发了一条消息，但是她少打一个字，她发的消息是晚饭去比尔酒吧。结果她的同事小思在晚饭时间到了比尔酒吧，结果发现没有人在那里。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小思最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 尴尬\nB) 气恼\nC) 激动\nD) 嫉妒\nE) 感激\nF) 没意识的\n\n## 问题 2\n小思为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 因为她是唯一一个出现在酒吧并觉得自己被放鸽子的人\nB) 她迟到了晚餐会议\nC) 她没有收到小杨的信息\nD) 她没有像其他人那样被邀请参加晚餐。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006690584973643243,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a7339aa9dc5a833d9d43","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794484019336,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:46:59","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"f634f4171d2345fb9d72869d58ad3a77"}